		Tenhou MJAI Riichi Mahjong Training Dataset







		Dataset Summary


This dataset contains processed four-player Japanese riichi Mahjong game
records derived from Tenhou MJAI/MJSON logs.
It is intended for:

Mahjong AI supervised pretraining;
Offline reinforcement learning;
Legal-action prediction;
Imitation learning;
Mahjong game analysis;
Evaluation of Mahjong agents.

This repository stores processed WebDataset shards rather than the original
Tenhou ZIP archives.… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/1nfrared218/tenhou-mjai-riichi-training.
